  "ruleText": "Med 403.04 Noncompliance. Failure to complete continuing medical education requirements or to submit documentation of such completion in a timely fashion, shall result in denial of license renewal.\n\nSource. #6517, eff 5-30-97, EXPIRED: 5-30-05\n\nNew. #8662, INTERIM, eff 6-16-06, EXPIRED: 12-13-06\n\nNew. #8945, eff 7-18-07; ss and renumbered by #9900, eff 4-12-11 (from Med 403.03) (see Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Med 400); ss by #12972, eff 1-10-20",
